Third-party recordings
Some sounds in assets/ were made from recordings their authors released under
CC0 1.0 (public domain): The Free Firearm Sound Library; Kenney Impact Sounds and
Kenney Voiceover Pack (kenney.nl); 80 CC0 creature SFX (OpenGameArt); Warfork sound
assets (Team Forbidden); and, for the music's instruments, Karoryfer Lecolds'
Emilyguitar, Big Rusty Drums and Black and Blue Basses, and Versilian Studios'
VS Chamber Orchestra 2: Community Edition. Those original recordings remain CC0. This notice covers
everything else, including the selection, editing and arrangement of those sounds.
The radio voices were generated with the Kokoro text-to-speech model (Apache-2.0).
